[ti:हर बार की कहानी]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Classical & Raga]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Piano E2 – rest – B2 – rest. Repeat. Silence 2 seconds. Tanpura enters.
[00:11.55]हर बार की कहानी में..
[00:15.10]क्या नया है जो सुनाए..
[00:18.65]प्यार बहुत होता है..
[00:22.20]जब तक पैसा बीच ना आए..
[00:25.75]Same story every time..
[00:29.30]What's new left to say?
[00:32.85]Love is easy, love is full..
[00:36.40]Till money finds its way.
[00:39.95]ना मैं सही ना तू गलत..
[00:43.50]सबको सिर्फ समय चलाए..
[00:47.06]I'm not right, you're not wrong..
[00:50.61]Time just drags us all along.
[00:54.16]क्या सच है क्या झूठ है..
[00:57.71]What is truth? What is a lie?
[01:01.26]Both together: Everyone decides what keeps them alive.
[01:04.81]जाने टूटे दिलों के टुकड़े..
[01:08.36]किसी और के आने से फिर जुड़ जाए..
[01:11.91]Broken hearts don't stay that way..
[01:15.46]Someone new walks in one day.
[01:19.01]Male: फिर धड़के दिल के तार..
[01:22.56]Female: The strings inside just start to play..
[01:26.11]Both unison: And love happens anyway.. फिर से प्यार यूं ही हो जाए..
[01:29.66]Hold final note 4 beats. Silence 2 beats.
[01:33.21]Male (spoken on pitch 3): लगा रह दिल किनारे से..
[01:36.76]Female (spoken one beat behind): Heart stays anchored to the shore..
[01:40.31]Male (half-sung 3-2-1): जाने कब तेरे नाम की लहर..
[01:43.86]Female (whispered): Waiting for your name.. a wave I've never seen before..
[01:47.41]Silence 3 seconds. Tanpura continues.
[01:50.96]Single piano note E2. Cello enters.
[01:54.51]Male (Hindi, warm, grounded):
[01:58.06]मत हो उदास ए दिल..
[02:01.62]ये खास नहीं है बात..
[02:05.17]Female (English, gentle, lullaby):
[02:08.72]Don't be sad, heart..
[02:12.27]This isn't special. This isn't new.
[02:15.82]Male: आएगा फिर सैलाब हार्मोन्स का..
[02:19.37]Female (underneath, softer): The flood will come again.. chemicals, waves, something true..
[02:22.92]Both unison (melody rises):
[02:26.47]तू रख पिया मिलन की आस..
[02:30.02]Female echoes one beat behind (English): keep the hope, keep the meeting, keep the you.
[02:33.57]आएगा..
